# NEVER commit — WhatsApp session + message history.
# These patterns are deliberately unanchored (no leading path): the daemon
# writes its db relative to whatever directory it was started from, so a run
# from the repo root would drop wa-session.db here, not under wad/.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db.*
wa-session*
*.backup-*
# build artifacts
wad/wad
.DS_Store

# Push test: a capability URL that can wake the phone.
endpoint.txt
pushtest/build/
